= Instructions

Stir all ingredients with @Ice{}: @Bourbon whiskey{1 1/2 oz}, 
@Overproof aged pot still rum{1/2 oz} (high-ester 4-6 years old), @Giffard Banane du Brésil liqueur{1/2 oz},
@Angostura Aromatic Bitters{3 dashes}.

Strain into ice-filled glass (preferably over a large cube or chunk of block ice).

@Lemon zest twist{} over the cocktail and use as garnish.